===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|lokinge}}, {{m|enm|lokunge}}, from {{inh|en|ang|*lōcung}} (attested in {{cog|ang|þurhlōcung}}), equivalent to {{af|en|look|-ing|id2=gerund noun}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# The act of one who looks; a [[glance]].
